{"id":"nacional","lemma":"nacional","pos":"adj","rank":1083,"glosses":["national, nationwide (of or relating to a nation)","national (native to a nation)"],"ipa":"/naθjoˈnal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"nacionales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/55/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-nacional.wav","examples":[{"text":"El lunes próximo es fiesta nacional.","en":"Next Monday is a national holiday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/721987","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"Monday"},{"g":"near"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"party"},null]},{"text":"Él se volvió un héroe nacional.","en":"He became a national hero.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to return","l":"volver"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"hero"},null]},{"text":"Está prohibido cazar en los parques nacionales.","en":"Hunting is banned in national parks.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/553672","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"forbidden"},{"g":"to hunt"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"park","l":"parque"},null]},{"text":"La deuda nacional está aumentando.","en":"The national debt is growing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/641871","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"debt"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to increase, grow","l":"aumentar"}]},{"text":"Ahora fumar está prohibido en todos los vuelos nacionales.","en":"Smoking is now prohibited on all domestic flights.","words":[{"g":"now"},{"g":"to smoke"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"forbidden"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"flight","l":"vuelo"},null]}]}